{"id":"bfd00740f4","t":"I Don’t Want to Be a magpie","c":"cv","n":125,"l":124,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie"},"u":1795038960301,"desc":"لقد تجسدت من جديد كشخصية داعمة في رواية رومانسية كئيبة، ومستقبل عائلتي المشؤوم بسبب الديون. كنت سأصبح موظفة حكومية لأكتسب بعض الروعة التي لم أحصل عليها في حياتي السابقة … لكن الأبطال يتصرفون بطريقة غريبة؟! “هل يجب أن أختطفكِ فقط …….” لف وجهه بكلتا يديه وظل هادئًا. تحول وجهه إلى اللون الأحمر الفاتح. وتحولت أذنيه للون الأحمر. لماذا أنتم يا رفاق تتلاعبون هكذا، من المفترض أن تكونوا مهووسين بالبطلة!","type":"مانهوا كورية","status":"OnGoing","genres":["رومانسى","شوجو","كوميدى","ويب تون"],"src":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/1/"},"2":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/2/"},"3":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/3/"},"4":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/4/"},"5":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/5/"},"6":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/6/"},"7":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/7/"},"8":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/8/"},"9":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/9/"},"10":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/10/"},"11":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/11/"},"12":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/12/"},"13":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/13/"},"14":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/14/"},"15":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/15/"},"16":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie/16/"},"17":{"ml":"i-dont-want-to-be-a-magpie|/manga/i-dont-want-